WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.969 --> 00:00:02.398
LAURA BARTON
I see those guys...

00:00:02.648 --> 00:00:04.070
Those gods.

00:00:04.391 --> 00:00:05.872
CLINT BARTON
You don't think they need me.

00:00:05.922 --> 00:00:06.989
LAURA BARTON
I think they do.

00:00:07.453 --> 00:00:10.302
You need to be sure
that this team is really a team.

00:00:12.648 --> 00:00:13.544
CLINT BARTON
Yes ma'am.

00:00:15.881 --> 00:00:17.720
THADDEUS ROSS
Many people see you as heroes.

00:00:17.771 --> 00:00:18.810
CLINT BARTON
I got him.

00:00:20.568 --> 00:00:21.564
THADDEUS ROSS
There are some

00:00:21.615 --> 00:00:23.107
who'd prefer the word vigilantes.

00:00:24.287 --> 00:00:25.698
CLINT BARTON
Doesn't matter what you did.

00:00:25.748 --> 00:00:28.445
You step out that door,
you are an Avenger.

